1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,256
Regarde ! Quelqu'un court avec des croissants !
Look! Someone is running with croissants!

2
00:00:05,756 --> 00:00:09,812
C'est un voleur ! Il court vite !
It's a thief! He runs fast!

3
00:00:10,312 --> 00:00:12,688
Vite, attrape-le !
Quick, catch him!

4
00:00:13,188 --> 00:00:16,788
Je l'ai ! Rends les croissants !
I've got him! Give back the croissants!

5
00:00:17,288 --> 00:00:19,568
Pourquoi tu les voles ?
Why are you stealing them?

6
00:00:20,068 --> 00:00:22,396
Il dit qu'il a très faim.
He says he's very hungry.

7
00:00:22,896 --> 00:00:27,480
Pauvre voleur ! Tiens, un croissant.
Poor thief! Here, a croissant.

8
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:32,492
Bravo, Bugaboo ! Tout le monde est content !
Well done, Bugaboo! Everyone is happy!

